.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4807:
	.ascii	"sh:lessThanOrEquals"
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4807, 19

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4808,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4808,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4808:
	.ascii	"A SHACL sh:lessThanOrEquals constraint orders the values at or below every node a property path (an IRI or any other SHACL 1.2 path) reaches from the focus node; JSON Schema constrains each property on its own and cannot relate one property's values to another path's, so the constraint is dropped."
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4808, 298

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4809,@object
	.section	.rodata.cst16,"aM",@progbits,16
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4809:
	.ascii	"sh:maxListLength"
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4809, 16

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4810,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4810,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4810:
	.ascii	"A SHACL 1.2 sh:maxListLength constraint bounds the member count of a list value node (as maxItems) or focus node (as maxItems of its rdf:rest, less its own member); the instance projection carries a list JSON-LD 1.1 converts (Processing Algorithms and API 8.4.2) as its @list array, which the schema judges exactly; a list it keeps as linked @graph nodes (a cell with another property, referenced twice, or an IRI) is a node reference whose members hang off other @graph nodes, and a JSON Schema keyword judges only the instance location it applies to and those beneath it ($ref resolves schemas, never instance values), so for such a value the constraint is not checked."
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4810, 671

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4811,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4811,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4811:
	.ascii	"sh:memberShape"
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4811, 14

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4812,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4812,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4812:
	.ascii	"A SHACL 1.2 sh:memberShape constraint judges every member of a list value node or focus node against a shape (as items); the instance projection carries a list JSON-LD 1.1 converts (Processing Algorithms and API 8.4.2) as its @list array, which the schema judges exactly; a list it keeps as linked @graph nodes (a cell with another property, referenced twice, or an IRI) is a node reference whose members hang off other @graph nodes, and a JSON Schema keyword judges only the instance location it applies to and those beneath it ($ref resolves schemas, never instance values), so for such a value the constraint is not checked."
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4812, 627

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4813,@object
	.section	.rodata.cst16,"aM",@progbits,16
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4813:
	.ascii	"sh:minListLength"
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4813, 16

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4814,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4814,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4814:
	.ascii	"A SHACL 1.2 sh:minListLength constraint bounds the member count of a list value node (as minItems) or focus node (as minItems of its rdf:rest, less its own member); the instance projection carries a list JSON-LD 1.1 converts (Processing Algorithms and API 8.4.2) as its @list array, which the schema judges exactly; a list it keeps as linked @graph nodes (a cell with another property, referenced twice, or an IRI) is a node reference whose members hang off other @graph nodes, and a JSON Schema keyword judges only the instance location it applies to and those beneath it ($ref resolves schemas, never instance values), so for such a value the constraint is not checked."
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4814, 671

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4815,@object
	.section	.rodata.cst8,"aM",@progbits,8
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4815:
	.ascii	"sh:class"
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4815, 8

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4816,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4816,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4816:
	.ascii	"A sh:class constraint on a node shape (one class or a SHACL list of them) judges the focus node's own class membership through the data graph's rdfs:subClassOf* triples, which live on other @graph nodes; a JSON Schema keyword judges only the instance location it applies to and those beneath it, so none reaches them, and the constraint is dropped."
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4816, 348

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4817,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4817,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4817:
	.ascii	"sh:closed sh:ByTypes"
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4817, 20

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4818,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4818,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4818:
	.ascii	"A SHACL 1.2 sh:closed sh:ByTypes constraint permits the properties each value node's own rdf:type values collect through the shapes graph; an object schema states one fixed key set for every instance, so the object is left open and the constraint is dropped (on a property shape, whose value nodes are node references, likewise)."
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4818, 329

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4819,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4819,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4819:
	.ascii	"sh:not"
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4819, 6

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4820,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4820,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4820:
	.ascii	"A sh:not negation whose inner shape is not losslessly expressible as a JSON Schema negation (or that appears at property/value position, where negating a base value schema would be vacuous) is dropped rather than emitted unsoundly."
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4820, 231

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4821,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4821,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4821:
	.ascii	"sh:nodeByExpression"
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4821, 19

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4822,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4822,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4822:
	.ascii	"A SHACL 1.2 sh:nodeByExpression constraint computes its node shape from a node expression evaluated against the data graph; a closed-world JSON Schema has no way to express a shape that is not known until validation time, so the constraint is dropped."
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4822, 251

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4823,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4823,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4823:
	.ascii	"sh:rootClass"
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4823, 12

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4824,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4824,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4824:
	.ascii	"A SHACL 1.2 sh:rootClass constraint bounds class-valued value nodes (or the focus node) by the data graph's rdfs:subClassOf hierarchy; a closed-world JSON Schema cannot consult that hierarchy, so the constraint is dropped."
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4824, 222

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4825,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4825,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4825:
	.ascii	"sh:someValue"
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4825, 12

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4826,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4826,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4826:
	.ascii	"A SHACL 1.2 sh:someValue constraint on a property shape requires at least one of the property's values to conform to a shape; the emitted value schema constrains each value alone, so the constraint is dropped (on a node shape it is projected as sh:node is)."
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4826, 257

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4827,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4827,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4827:
	.ascii	"sh:sparql"
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4827, 9

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4828,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4828,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4828:
	.ascii	"A SHACL-SPARQL constraint (sh:sparql) has no closed-world JSON Schema equivalent and is dropped."
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4828, 96

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4829,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4829,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4829:
	.ascii	"sh:subsetOf"
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4829, 11

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4830,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4830,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4830:
	.ascii	"A SHACL 1.2 sh:subsetOf constraint requires every value to be among the nodes a property path reaches from the focus node; JSON Schema constrains each property on its own and cannot relate one property's values to another path's, so the constraint is dropped."
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4830, 259

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4831,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4831,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4831:
	.ascii	"sh:targetNode"
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4831, 13

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4832,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4832,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4832:
	.ascii	"A shape targeted only via sh:targetNode selects specific focus nodes (a constant, or the output nodes of a node expression), not a class extension; it has no closed-world JSON Schema $def and its constraints are not enforced by the emitted schema."
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4832, 247

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4833,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4833,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4833:
	.ascii	"sh:targetObjectsOf"
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4833, 18

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4834,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4834,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4834:
	.ascii	"A shape targeted only via sh:targetObjectsOf selects focus nodes by a predicate's object position, not a class extension; no closed-world JSON Schema $def can be keyed and its constraints are not enforced."
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4834, 205

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4835,@object
