	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4835, 19

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4836,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4836,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4836:
	.ascii	"A shape targeted only via sh:targetSubjectsOf selects focus nodes by a predicate's subject position, not a class extension; no closed-world JSON Schema $def can be keyed and its constraints are not enforced."
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4836, 207

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4837,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4837,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4837:
	.ascii	"sh:targetWhere"
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4837, 14

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4838,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4838,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4838:
	.ascii	"A shape targeted via sh:targetWhere selects the nodes that conform to another shape, not a class extension; it has no closed-world JSON Schema $def and its constraints are not enforced by the emitted schema."
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4838, 207

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4839,@object
	.section	.rodata.cst16,"aM",@progbits,16
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4839:
	.ascii	"sh:uniqueMembers"
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4839, 16

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4840,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4840,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4840:
	.ascii	"A SHACL 1.2 sh:uniqueMembers constraint (true: no repeated member; false: only a list) judges a list value node or focus node (as uniqueItems); the instance projection carries a list JSON-LD 1.1 converts (Processing Algorithms and API 8.4.2) as its @list array, which the schema judges exactly; a list it keeps as linked @graph nodes (a cell with another property, referenced twice, or an IRI) is a node reference whose members hang off other @graph nodes, and a JSON Schema keyword judges only the instance location it applies to and those beneath it ($ref resolves schemas, never instance values), so for such a value the constraint is not checked. On a node shape the focus node's own member (its rdf:first) is not compared with the members of its rdf:rest, two instance locations no JSON Schema keyword relates."
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4840, 815

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4841,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4841,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4841:
	.ascii	"sh:uniqueValuesFor"
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4841, 18

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4842,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4842,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4842:
	.ascii	"A SHACL 1.2 sh:uniqueValuesFor constraint forbids two target nodes of a shape from having exactly the same values for the listed properties; a JSON Schema judges one instance alone (uniqueItems is uniqueness within one array, not across instances), so the constraint is dropped."
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4842, 278

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4843,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4843,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4843:
	.ascii	"sh:values"
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4843, 9

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4844,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4844,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4844:
	.ascii	"A SHACL 1.2 property shape with sh:values takes the output nodes of a node expression evaluated at validation as value nodes, which a JSON document does not carry; projecting its constraints onto the document's own values would require what a computed value supplies, so the property shape is dropped."
	.size	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4844, 301

	.type	.Lanon.447fff4b9dda9460ad50c7a2ae3359e8.4845,@object
